WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:02.000
I’ve got to like, calm down.

00:00:03.417 --> 00:00:07.417
I didn’t really expect I would do a documentary,

00:00:07.417 --> 00:00:11.917
but for some reason, my life became so overwhelming, and

00:00:11.917 --> 00:00:16.375
it stopped becoming about me, it became about the world.

00:00:21.792 --> 00:00:27.583
I grew up not understanding myself.

00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:30.166
And, I had to figure out what kind of

00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:31.750
woman I wanted to become.

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:36.792
And when I started to realize all this stuff was going on

00:00:36.792 --> 00:00:40.709
that I couldn’t control sometimes even,

00:00:40.709 --> 00:00:43.125
was terrifying.

00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:46.000
But I know who I am, and I know who I want to be

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.917
and nothing or anyone will ever take that away from me.

00:00:51.917 --> 00:00:55.709
And if I could share and make someone else feel that way,

00:00:56.625 --> 00:00:58.083
then I’ve won.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.417
♪My mind and me♪

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:05.125
♪It’s only my mind and me♪

00:01:05.417 --> 00:01:08.333
♪My mind and me♪

